# Fault f_before's twin (writer 6): without `before`, observations and plans come first (L §5.14.2 "Observations and
# plans come first, since they read nothing running"), so sweep reads konto after wage: max(0, 1 PLN) = 1.00 PLN, and
# its register lists wage.
=== f_after.tally
model fbefore
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-31

source s "synthetic"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place save: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

input day: date

move sweep: transfers
  on day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to save amount max(0, bal(konto))

move wage: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1 PLN

ask q: flows(sweep, 2026-01-15) law 2026-01-31

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  day = 2026-01-15 "row"
=== expect
q: 1.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: sweep
  unfulfilled: wage
  law date 2026-01-31, cut 2026-01-31
